Convx-derived work in Musiku
============================

## Flamingo lyrics renderer

The lyrics renderer in
`app/src/main/java/app/musiku/ui/lyrics/flamingo/` (FlamingoLyricView,
LyricsFollowScroll, LyricsGlow, SweepBrush, YosUIConfig, YosMediaEvent,
YosWrapper) is adapted from Flamingo
(https://github.com/shouryadixitisverycool/Flamingo) by Yos-X and
contributors, licensed under GPL-3.0.

## Player glyphs and chrome

The `flamingo_*` vector drawables, the shuffle/repeat glyphs, and the player
chrome measurements in `ui/nowplaying/` are taken from Convx
(https://github.com/convx/Convx), licensed under GPL-3.0.
